file tools/fixtures/j/journal_query_census.sh the census -- seven-plus-four classes, a file-level upper bound, and every unanticipated line printed with its path
file tools/fixtures/j/journal_query_control.sh 26 behaviors in a pen, the field class planted twice -- once where the line sees it, once where only the bound does
file tools/j/journal_query_witness.rish binds verdict=sorted_room, a tripwire on a research claim rather than a wall on a commit
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri rosters journal_query at tier cadence with the reading and the reason for the tier
