file construction/archive/20260907-201914_itinerary-landed-accounts.md the elder account, shelved rather than condensed
scope one research lap: measure the falsifier, land census plus control plus witness, write the paper, close one red found at the open
status GREEN -- journal_query witness green, fold_shelf_link repaired green, cold roster 97 green with its one red closed
